{"seq":3,"slug":"metric-driven-compilation","title":"指标驱动编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-optimization-dspy/optimizers/metric-driven-compilation","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"指标驱动编译\">指标驱动编译</h1><p>自举挑示例、MIPRO 写指令，两者看似各干各的，其实共享同一根中枢神经：<strong>指标</strong>。优化器之间唯一稳定不变的契约，是「给我一个能给输出打分的函数，我去把分数顶到最高」。理解这根中枢，比记住任何单个优化器的名字都重要——换优化器只是换搜索算法，指标这个接口不变。这一篇把 <code>metric</code>、<code>compile</code>、<code>trace</code> 三件事讲到能自己写出正确的优化脚本为止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自举挑示例、MIPRO 写指令，看似各干各的，其实共享同一根中枢神经：<strong>指标</strong>。它是优化器之间唯一稳定不变的契约。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指标即目标函数</strong>：不是事后验收的标尺，而是被直接优化的目标——写错了，优化器会忠实地把你引向错误的山顶。</li>\n<li><strong>一个函数两副面孔</strong>：<code>metric(example, prediction, trace=None)</code> 在评估时（<code>trace is None</code>）当连续标尺，在编译时当自举示例的硬闸门。</li>\n<li><strong>compile 是统一动词</strong>：吃学生程序 + 数据 + 指标，吐带提示的同结构新程序，可存盘复用。</li>\n<li><strong>契约只外扩不破坏</strong>：GEPA 的反馈型指标在标量之外加 <code>feedback</code> 文字，旧优化器忽略它即可兼容，故能统一两代优化器。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^* = \\arg\\max_{\\theta} \\; \\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim D}\\big[ \\, m(y,\\, f_\\theta(x)) \\, \\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"指标是优化的目标函数\">指标是优化的目标函数</h2><p>DSPy 把提示优化形式化成一个搜索问题：在所有可能的「指令文字 × 少样本示例」配置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 里，找一个让期望分数最高的配置。形式化地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^* = \\arg\\max_{\\theta} \\; \\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim D}\\big[ \\, m(y,\\, f_\\theta(x)) \\, \\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6021em;vertical-align:-0.7521em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是配了某套提示的程序，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是你写的指标，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是训练/验证分布。优化器（teleprompter）做的就是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 空间里搜，把这个期望往上抬。所以指标不是「跑完之后验收的标尺」，它就是被直接优化的目标——指标定义错了，优化器会忠实地把你引向错误的山顶。</p>\n<p>指标是一个普通 Python 函数，签名固定为三个位置参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def metric(example, prediction, trace=None):&#10;    # example: 训练样本（含标签 example.answer）&#10;    # prediction: 程序对该样本的输出（pred.answer）&#10;    # trace: 仅在编译期非 None，承载完整执行轨迹&#10;    return example.answer.lower() == prediction.answer.lower()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(example, prediction, trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # example: 训练样本（含标签 example.answer）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # prediction: 程序对该样本的输出（pred.answer）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # trace: 仅在编译期非 None，承载完整执行轨迹</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example.answer.lower() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prediction.answer.lower()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回值可以是 <code>bool</code>、<code>float</code> 或 <code>int</code>。布尔等价于 0/1，浮点适合「部分正确」的软指标（如 F1、语义相似度）。优化器对这个值的唯一假设是「越大越好」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"trace-参数-同一函数的两副面孔\">trace 参数：同一函数的两副面孔</h2><p><code>metric</code> 第三个参数 <code>trace</code> 是 DSPy 一个精巧的设计：同一个函数，在<strong>评估</strong>时和<strong>编译</strong>时承担不同语义，靠 <code>trace is None</code> 区分。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>评估时（<code>dspy.Evaluate</code> 调用），<code>trace=None</code>，指标返回连续分数，用于报告整体表现。</li>\n<li>编译时（优化器内部调用），<code>trace</code> 是该样本完整的执行轨迹列表，此时指标常被当作<strong>硬过滤器</strong>——只有返回 <code>True</code> 的轨迹才会被自举收集成示例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这就是为什么自举里「指标当闸门」与评估里「指标当标尺」是同一个函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def metric(example, pred, trace=None):&#10;    correct = example.answer.lower() == pred.answer.lower()&#10;    if trace is None:&#10;        return correct          # 评估：返回分数&#10;    return correct              # 编译：返回是否收为示例（这里也可加更严的条件）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(example, pred, trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    correct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example.answer.lower() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pred.answer.lower()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> correct          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 评估：返回分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> correct              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译：返回是否收为示例（这里也可加更严的条件）</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用场景</th>\n<th><code>trace</code> 值</th>\n<th>返回值语义</th>\n<th>谁在调</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评估整体表现</td>\n<td><code>None</code></td>\n<td>连续分数（越大越好）</td>\n<td><code>dspy.Evaluate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自举筛选示例</td>\n<td>轨迹列表</td>\n<td>布尔闸门（是否收为 demo）</td>\n<td><code>BootstrapFewShot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIPRO 验证组合</td>\n<td>视实现</td>\n<td>分数</td>\n<td><code>MIPROv2</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>利用这个区分，你可以让编译期的过滤比评估期更严格——例如评估时算 F1，编译时只收 F1=1.0 的完美轨迹做示例，保证种子质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"compile-把声明式程序变成带提示的程序\">compile：把声明式程序变成带提示的程序</h2><p>所有优化器对外暴露同一个动词：<code>compile</code>。它吃进一个「学生」程序、一批训练数据、一个指标，吐出一个<strong>同结构但提示已填好</strong>的新程序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[学生程序&lt;br/&gt;仅有签名与模块] --&gt; C[optimizer.compile]&#10;  D[trainset 带标签] --&gt; C&#10;  M[metric 指标函数] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; Sea[搜索 θ 空间&lt;br/&gt;指令×示例配置]&#10;  Sea --&gt;|metric 打分爬坡| Sea&#10;  Sea --&gt; P[编译后程序&lt;br/&gt;提示已填入指令与示例]&#10;  P --&gt; Inf[直接推理 / 保存复用]\">flowchart TD\n  S[学生程序&lt;br/&gt;仅有签名与模块] --&gt; C[optimizer.compile]\n  D[trainset 带标签] --&gt; C\n  M[metric 指标函数] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; Sea[搜索 θ 空间&lt;br/&gt;指令×示例配置]\n  Sea --&gt;|metric 打分爬坡| Sea\n  Sea --&gt; P[编译后程序&lt;br/&gt;提示已填入指令与示例]\n  P --&gt; Inf[直接推理 / 保存复用]</pre><p>「编译」这个词是刻意借来的：源代码（签名+模块，见 <a href=\"../foundations/signatures-modules\">签名与模块</a>）经过一个优化过程，变成可执行的产物（带具体提示的程序），中间的优化器就像编译器的优化 pass。编译产物可以 <code>compiled.save(&quot;prog.json&quot;)</code> 存盘，部署时直接 <code>load</code> 回来，不必每次重新优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈型指标-gepa-的额外契约\">反馈型指标：GEPA 的额外契约</h2><p>普通指标只返回标量，但 <a href=\"instruction-optimization-mipro\">GEPA</a> 的反思机制需要更多——它要读懂「为什么错」。因此 GEPA 的指标除了打分，还要能返回<strong>自然语言反馈</strong>，告诉优化器这次输出哪里不对。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dspy import Prediction&#10;&#10;def feedback_metric(example, pred, trace=None, pred_name=None, pred_trace=None):&#10;    score = compute_score(example, pred)&#10;    if score &lt; 1.0:&#10;        fb = f&quot;答案 &#39;{pred.answer}&#39; 与标准答案 &#39;{example.answer}&#39; 不符；注意单位换算。&quot;&#10;    else:&#10;        fb = &quot;正确。&quot;&#10;    return Prediction(score=score, feedback=fb)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prediction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> feedback_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(example, pred, trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, pred_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, pred_trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_score(example, pred)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"答案 '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pred.answer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' 与标准答案 '</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">example.answer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' 不符；注意单位换算。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"正确。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prediction(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">feedback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fb)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段文字反馈正是 GEPA 反思演化的燃料：它把多条样本的反馈喂给一个模型，让模型诊断系统性失败模式，再据此改写指令。普通优化器忽略 <code>feedback</code> 字段，所以反馈型指标对 MIPROv2、自举也兼容——这就是为什么「指标驱动」能统一两代优化器：接口只往外扩，不破坏旧契约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写好指标的三条经验\">写好指标的三条经验</h2><p>指标是整个优化的指挥棒，写歪一点点，优化器就跑偏一大截。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>别把指标写成可被作弊的代理</strong>。如果指标只查关键词是否出现，优化器会学会堆砌关键词而非真答对。指标要尽量贴近你真正在乎的业务质量。这与 <a href=\"../practice/evaluation-iteration\">评估与迭代</a> 里讲的「评估集划分」是一体两面——指标和数据共同定义了优化目标。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>软指标比硬指标更利于爬坡</strong>。全 0/1 的指标在搜索空间里是一片平地加几个尖峰，优化器拿不到梯度信号；连续分数（部分匹配、相似度）能让优化器分辨「差一点」和「差很多」，搜索更顺。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>指标里可以调用语言模型</strong>。复杂任务（开放式生成、摘要）没有精确标签，常用 LLM-as-judge 当指标。这把评测里的 LLM 裁判方法论引进来，系统讲解在 <a href=\"../../llm-app-eval-observability/offline-evaluation/regression-pipelines\">37 LLM 应用评测·离线评估</a> 与 <a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/automated-evaluation\">28 AI 评测基准·自动化评估</a>，本篇只强调它能直接当 <code>metric</code> 接进优化循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指标是优化的目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta^* = \\arg\\max_\\theta \\mathbb{E}[m(y, f_\\theta(x))]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))]</span></span></span></span></span>，不是事后验收的标尺——写错会被优化器忠实放大。</li>\n<li><code>metric(example, prediction, trace=None)</code> 是统一契约：<code>trace is None</code> 时当评估标尺，非 None 时当自举的示例闸门，同一函数两副面孔。</li>\n<li><code>compile</code> 是所有优化器的统一动词：吃学生程序+数据+指标，吐带提示的新程序，可存盘复用。</li>\n<li>GEPA 用反馈型指标（返回 <code>score</code>+<code>feedback</code>）扩展契约，文字反馈驱动反思；扩展向后兼容，故能统一两代优化器。</li>\n<li>写指标三戒：别写成可作弊的代理、优先软指标利于爬坡、复杂任务可用 LLM-as-judge 直接当指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"bootstrap-few-shot\">自举少样本</a> — <code>trace</code> 闸门如何筛选示例。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"instruction-optimization-mipro\">指令优化 MIPRO</a> — 标量指标与 GEPA 反馈型指标的两种用法。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../practice/evaluation-iteration\">评估与迭代</a> — 指标与评估集如何共同定义优化目标。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/automated-evaluation\">28 AI 评测基准·自动化评估</a> — LLM-as-judge 作为指标的方法论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"指标驱动编译","id":"指标驱动编译"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指标是优化的目标函数","id":"指标是优化的目标函数"},{"level":2,"text":"trace 参数：同一函数的两副面孔","id":"trace-参数-同一函数的两副面孔"},{"level":2,"text":"compile：把声明式程序变成带提示的程序","id":"compile-把声明式程序变成带提示的程序"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈型指标：GEPA 的额外契约","id":"反馈型指标-gepa-的额外契约"},{"level":2,"text":"写好指标的三条经验","id":"写好指标的三条经验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"指令优化 MIPRO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-optimization-dspy/optimizers/instruction-optimization-mipro"},"next":{"title":"多阶段流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-optimization-dspy/pipelines/multi-stage-pipelines"}}